{{also|groundout}}
==English==

===Etymology 1===

====Verb====
{{en-verb|*}}

# {{lb|en|electronics}} To provide proper [[grounding]] for a circuit.
# {{lb|en|baseball}} To become [[out]] by hitting a [[ground ball]] which is fielded and leads to a force or tag of a runner.
#: ''Jones '''grounded out''' to lead off the third.''

